# ── NOT A CONVENIENCE. THE REASON THIS FILE EXISTS. ──────────────────────────
#
# The Wecycle repository is PUBLIC (github.com/madhavnrathi-droid/Wecycle).
#
# db/data/ is where tools/export-data.mjs writes the exported database: 99 real
# students' names, email addresses, bcrypt password hashes and phone numbers,
# and the 57-address SIGCHI roster. Committing it would publish all of that
# permanently — a force-push does not un-publish a commit that has been fetched.
#
# Keep the data out of here. Move it to the server privately, load it, delete it.
data/
*-data.sql
*.bak
*.bacpac
